		if((x1/p3==x2/p3)&&(GetBetween(x1/p3,y1/p3,y2/p3))){
			tmp=min(min(x1%p3,x2%p3)+1LL,p3-max(x1%p3,x2%p3));
			ans=max(ans,tmp);
		}
		p3*=3LL;
	}
	return ans;
}
